    {
      "id": "file:code/server/index.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "index.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/index.js",
      "summary": "Express 后端服务入口文件，挂载 CORS 和 JSON 中间件，注册 /api/decks、/api/learn、/api/ai 三个路由模块，提供健康检查端点和全局错误处理，监听 3001 端口。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "server", "express", "middleware"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:code/server/routes/ai.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "ai.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/routes/ai.js",
      "summary": "AI 相关路由模块，提供 POST /api/ai/test（测试 AI 连接）和 GET /api/ai/presets（获取预设模型配置）两个端点，依赖 aiService 处理业务逻辑。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "route", "express", "ai"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:code/server/routes/decks.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "decks.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/routes/decks.js",
      "summary": "牌组相关路由模块，提供 GET /api/decks（获取 ShiYi 牌组列表）、GET /api/decks/status（检查 Anki-Connect 连接状态）和 GET /api/decks/all（调试端点返回全部牌组），依赖 ankiService 处理业务逻辑。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "route", "express", "anki"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:code/server/routes/learn.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "learn.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/routes/learn.js",
      "summary": "学习流程核心路由模块，编排完整的卡片学习生命周期：POST /start（开始学习并生成 AI 场景）、POST /respond（用户回复后 AI 评判掌握程度）、POST /complete（完成当前卡片并更新 Anki）、POST /next（获取下一张卡片）、GET /progress（查询学习进度），协调 ankiService、aiService 和 sessionService 三个服务层。",
      "tags": ["api-handler", "route", "express", "learning-flow", "orchestration"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:code/server/services/aiService.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "aiService.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/aiService.js",
      "summary": "AI 多模型服务层，封装 OpenAI 兼容 API 调用，支持千问/豆包/OpenAI 等模型提供商，提供学习场景生成（generateScenario）和用户回复评判（judgeResponse）两大核心能力，内置鲁棒的 AI JSON 响应解析器（parseAIJson）处理各模型不规范的 JSON 输出。",
      "tags": ["service", "ai", "openai", "scenario-generation", "nlp"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "使用 OpenAI SDK 统一调用多家兼容 API（千问 dashscope、豆包 ark），内置多策略 JSON 提取器以应对 LLM 返回格式不一致的问题；预设 MODEL_PRESETS 配置提供四组模型预设（qwen/doubao/openai/custom）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:code/server/services/ankiService.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "ankiService.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/ankiService.js",
      "summary": "Anki-Connect API 服务层，封装与本地 Anki 应用的 JSON-RPC 通信（localhost:8765），提供牌组查询、到期卡片获取、已知词汇收集、卡片评分提交和连接状态检查等功能，特别处理 Windows 下中文牌组名 UTF-8 编码问题（统一使用 did: 牌组 ID 查询）。",
      "tags": ["service", "anki", "anki-connect", "flashcard", "json-rpc"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "所有 Anki-Connect 查询通过 did:（牌组 ID）而非 deck:（牌组名）以避免 Windows 版 Anki-Connect 的中文 UTF-8 解码错误；invoke 函数封装统一的 JSON-RPC 请求/错误处理模式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:code/server/services/sessionService.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "sessionService.js",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/sessionService.js",
      "summary": "学习会话管理服务，基于内存 Map 存储每个牌组的会话状态，跟踪当前卡片、对话历史、连续失败次数和评分统计，支持 2 小时 TTL 自动过期机制，提供 formatScenarioMessage 将 AI 生成的场景 JSON 格式化为可读文本。",
      "tags": ["service", "session", "state-management", "in-memory"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "使用 Map 实现内存会话存储，通过 setTimeout/clearTimeout 实现会话自动过期（TTL=2小时），每次 getSession 刷新计时器实现滑动过期策略。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:code/server/services/aiService.js:parseAIJson",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "parseAIJson",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/aiService.js",
      "lineRange": [24, 89],
      "summary": "从 AI 返回的文本中鲁棒地提取 JSON 对象，依次尝试：去除 markdown 代码块后解析、花括号配对提取第一个完整 JSON 对象、直接 parse 兜底，处理各 LLM（千问/豆包等）不规范输出。",
      "tags": ["utility", "json-parsing", "robust", "ai-integration"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:code/server/services/aiService.js:createClient",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "createClient",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/aiService.js",
      "lineRange": [122, 134],
      "summary": "根据 provider 预设配置创建 OpenAI 客户端实例，解析最终的 baseURL 和 model，验证 API Key 存在性。",
      "tags": ["factory", "client", "openai", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:code/server/services/aiService.js:generateScenario",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "generateScenario",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/aiService.js",
      "lineRange": [147, 258],
      "summary": "根据卡片类型（read/write/listen/speak）调用 AI 生成沉浸式英语学习场景，传入已知词汇列表以约束 AI 用词范围，返回包含场景描述、问题和提示的结构化 JSON。",
      "tags": ["scenario-generation", "ai", "prompt-engineering", "english-learning"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:code/server/services/aiService.js:judgeResponse",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "judgeResponse",
      "filePath": "code/server/services/aiService.js",
