      "summary": "调用 AI 评判用户回复的掌握程度，返回 ease 评分（1=Again, 3=Good, 4=Easy）和鼓励性反馈，根据连续失败次数调整评判宽松度以防止挫败感。",
      "tags": ["judgment", "ai", "scoring", "adaptive"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:code/server/services/aiService.js:testConnection",
